Package: chleb-bible-search
Architecture: all
Depends: chleb-bible-search-core (= ${core:Version}), chleb-bible-search-dict-free (>= ${free:Version}),
 chleb-bible-search-thesaurus (>= ${thesaurus:Version})
Description: Chleb Bible Search - Bible Query Service (meta-package)
 This is a meta package that installs both the core bible search service, which provides the main
 functionality for searching within the Bible text, the public-domain translations, and the thesaurus data
 used for interpreting search queries.

