Package: chleb-bible-search-dict-free
Architecture: all
Depends: chleb-bible-search-core (>= ${core:Version})
Replaces: chleb-bible-search-dict
Description: Chleb Bible Search - Public domain translations
 This package contains the public domain translations used by the Chleb Bible Search
 service.
 .
 American Standard Version (1901)
 Douay-Rheims (1610)
 King James Version (1611)

Package: chleb-bible-search-thesaurus
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Chleb Bible Search - global thesaurus
 This package contains the global thesaurus data used to expand search terms
 and provide relevant suggestions.

Package: chleb-bible-search-dict-pickthall
Architecture: all
Depends: chleb-bible-search-core (>= ${core:Version})
Description: Chleb Bible Search - Pickthall translation
 This package contains the Pickthall translation of the Quran used by the
 Chleb Bible Search service.
 .
